<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Bad Gastein &amp; Lungau Guide: 10 places – waterfall, Landawirsee, spa &amp; hut – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Gastein waterfall</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go early or in the evening when it is quiet – and look at the hotels around it. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>13.13636,47.11354,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Belle Époque architecture &amp; Straubinger Platz</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go to the waterfall in the evening and look at the lights of the hotels. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>13.13697,47.11422,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Felsentherme Bad Gastein</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Plan the spa for the afternoon after a hike. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>13.13338,47.11103,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Stubnerkogel &amp; suspension bridge</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go up in clear weather and early in the day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>13.08602,47.13695,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Graukogel – a quieter hiking summit</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Start early and use the mid-station if you want a shorter hike. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>13.15623,47.11109,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Empress Elisabeth Promenade</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go in the morning and combine it with a café visit. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>13.12914,47.10544,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Mauterndorf Castle in the Lungau</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Combine the castle with a detour to the Landawirsee hike. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>13.67815,47.13741,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Gastein Healing Gallery – warmth in the mountain</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Ask your doctor beforehand whether it is suitable for you. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bad-gastein/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>13.09727,47.08008,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
